@@section 1
@@title SQ-CGE Creative Common 1.1.0 of 2026-11-08 00:01: low gravity for falling blocks, items and TNT, and the re-check list for the publish ([creative_engineering.md](../creative_engineering.md) 7.1, TODO `creativecommon/publish #3`)
@@date 2026-11-08
@@jars creativecommon creativeengineering
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_engineering.md
@@prep A: boot=2: run sed -i 's|^biome_configs = .*|biome_configs = ["#minecraft:is_end;;-1", "minecraft:plains;;"]|' "$(sed -n "s/^level-name=//p" server.properties)"/serverconfig/create_gravity-server.toml
@@text
@@text Not run. Targets `development/creativeCommon/build/libs/creativecommon-1.1.0.jar` of 2026-11-08 00:01 (newer than the 2026-11-07 20:28 jar in `mods/`; prep_srv.sh and `cc_only_srv.sh` swap it in, install it in `mods/` only with the game closed). New code: `CreateGravityEntitiesMixin` (gated on `create_gravity`; `require = 0`, so a wrong method name skips silently: SQ-CGE-02 is the real check). Servers: full pack for SQ-CGE-01 to -05, `bash tools/scratch_query/cc_only_srv.sh OUT LEVEL full` for SQ-CGE-06. Probe scripts go in `tools/scratch_query/` (`cge_probe.js` or `.qb` batch `batches/r1108cge/`).
@@text Entity speed rows: `/forceload add 0 0`, summon at y 120 over the End main island (0, 120, 0) and over a flat overworld spot, read `Pos[1]` after 20 and 40 ticks with `data get entity @e[type=...,limit=1] Pos[1] 1000`; vanilla pull is -0.04 per tick, so 40 ticks drop about 27 blocks, and Create Gravity's default End factor -0.8 should leave about a fifth of that.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-CGE-01 | boots, no mixin error naming the Create Gravity mixins
@group A (full pack, new Common)
@commands boot; `grep -nE "Mixin apply failed\|InvalidMixinException\|CreateGravity\|outside the tested range" logs/latest.log \| head`
@pass no mixin error or WARN naming `CreateGravityEntitiesMixin` or `CreateGravityDimensionMixin`; boots
@fails `mixins.json` / `NEEDS_MOD` entry, Create Gravity 1.2.0 class names
@from batches/r1108cge/b1_full.qb
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException
bootreject (?i)(CreateGravityEntitiesMixin|CreateGravityDimensionMixin).*(error|fail|warn)
bootreject outside the tested range.*create_gravity
bootexpect Done \(
look Done line present; no WARN/ERROR naming either Create Gravity mixin

