@@section 2
@@title SQ-CGE part 2: low gravity for every falling entity without motion packets, dimension limit, End oxygen, script phase, physics tags, 2026-11-08 ([creative_engineering.md](../creative_engineering.md) 7.4, TODO `creativecommon/publish #3`)
@@date 2026-11-08
@@jars creativecommon creativeengineering
@@sources feature_writeup/creative_engineering.md
@@prep A: boot=2: run sed -i 's|^biome_configs = .*|biome_configs = ["#minecraft:is_end;;-1", "#minecraft:is_nether;;"]|' "$(sed -n "s/^level-name=//p" server.properties)"/serverconfig/create_gravity-server.toml
@@prep A: boot=3: toml creativecommon-common.toml perf gravityDimensions ["minecraft:the_end", "minecraft:the_nether"]
@@prep difficulty=normal
@@text
@@text Targets Common `creativecommon-1.1.0` and Compat `creativecompat-1.0.0` of 2026-11-08 15:08 (build/libs, NOT installed; install the two together: the new Common moves only files headed `// phase: helpers` ahead of `startup_scripts/`, and only the new Compat has that header on `jei_order.js`). New mixins `LowGravityPullMixin` (items, falling blocks, TNT, minecarts, Shulker bullets), `LowGravitySlowPullMixin` (XP orbs, fishing bobbers), `LowGravityArrowMixin`, `LowGravityLlamaSpitMixin`, `LowGravityBoatMixin` (out of water only), `LowGravityThrowableMixin`, `LowGravityItemPhysicMixin` (items under ItemPhysic), accessor `CreateGravityConfigAccessor`; all `require = 1`, so a wrong target crashes the boot (SQ-CGE-07 is the first row of the first boot).
@@text
@@text **How to run** (all scripted, one game JVM at a time; targeted run, no perf session):
@@text - Server, five boots in one go (b5 = SQ-CGE-16, ItemPhysic without Create Gravity): `bash tools/scratch_query/cge2_run.sh server OUT` (OUT under the session scratchpad). b1 full pack group A superflat (level r1108cge2, configs as generated) -> b2 same world with Create Gravity `biome_configs = ["#minecraft:is_end;;-1", "#minecraft:is_nether;;"]` -> b3 same world with Common `gravityDimensions = ["minecraft:the_end", "minecraft:the_nether"]` -> b4 `cc_only_srv.sh full` (Common without Compat). The runner copies Common and Compat from build/libs into each srv (refuses if they are not these builds), edits the configs while stopped (Forge writes its copy back on shutdown), stops on a boot crash. Results `perf/runs/r1108cge2/b1..b4/`.
@@text - Client, single player: `cge2_run.sh client OUT GAME` (throwaway client, the two jars copied into its mods/, the b1 world as CGE2), then `eval_client.py launch GAME`, open CGE2, `qrun.py client GAME tools/scratch_query/batches/r1108cge2/c1_sp.qb perf/runs/r1108cge2/c1`.
@@text - Client joined to a dedicated server (needs a client and a server up together, which the one-game-JVM rule does not allow an agent to start; owner's call; the only path that uses the synced config on the client): `cge2_run.sh join OUT` (b1 srv with default configs, left up), in the client Multiplayer > Direct Connection > `localhost:25599`, `cge2_run.sh op OUT`, then `qrun.py client GAME .../c2_join.qb perf/runs/r1108cge2/c2`; `cge2_run.sh stop OUT` after.
@@text - Fall rows are judged by `tools/scratch_query/cge_judge.py` (per type: End drop / overworld drop at 40 ticks; `low` 0.10-0.30, `zero` under 0.01 blocks, `same` within 2 percent); probe `cge_probe.js` `/zgv dropall` drops a falling block, item, TNT, XP orb, arrow, snowball, boat, minecart and llama spit.
@@text
@@table
## SQ-CGE-07 | boots; every LowGravity mixin applied; startup order with the helper phase
@group A b1 (A, full pack)
@commands boot; batch `b1_full.qb`
@pass no mixin / injection error; startup order `creativecommon, creativecompat_helpers, startup_scripts, ... creativecompat`; `creativecompat: 1 helper file(s) run before startup_scripts`; `[jeiOrder] defined`; 0 startup errors
@fails the constant in the failing `LowGravity*Mixin` (javap the target), `JarStartupScripts.splitHelpers`, the header in Compat's `jei_order.js`
@from batches/r1108cge2/b1_full.qb
bootreject Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|InjectionError|InvalidInjectionException
bootreject (?i)(LowGravity|CreateGravity)\w*Mixin.*(error|fail|warn)
bootexpect Done \(
shell grep -E "packs in order" logs/kubejs/startup.log | grep -q "creativecommon, creativecompat_helpers, startup_scripts, .*creativecompat" && echo "order ok"
shell grep -q "creativecompat: 1 helper file(s) run before startup_scripts" logs/kubejs/startup.log && echo "helper line ok"
shell grep -q "\[jeiOrder\] defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log && echo "jeiOrder ok"
shell test "$(grep -c '\[ERROR\]' logs/kubejs/startup.log)" = 0 && echo "0 startup errors"
look shell.txt holds the four ok lines (each shell step exits 1 when its check fails)

